{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792433721429,"sessionID":"ses_eaaa01f8affesgSTHulR12a46T","part":{"partID":"prt_155600fdd001OZUveO0tskzYCE","sessionID":"ses_eaaa01f8affesgSTHulR12a46T","messageID":"msg_1556003860018Fz8MOPCeX2qxC","type":"tool","id":"call_00_462twlon5ct3zzl0hcr8x4a7","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-4/blueprint-code-0-1/source/REVISION.md"},"output":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-4/blueprint-code-0-1/source/REVISION.md, lines 1-1\n1: 仅消费绑定 failed job plan-1 的宿主受限补丁；保留原聚合修复范围和其余规格。独立设计/程序语义审阅、冻结模板审阅、正式发布与真实运行仍分别验收。","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-4/blueprint-code-0-1/source/REVISION.md, lines 1-1\n1: 仅消费绑定 failed job plan-1 的宿主受限补丁；保留原聚合修复范围和其余规格。独立设计/程序语义审阅、冻结模板审阅、正式发布与真实运行仍分别验收。"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-4/blueprint-code-0-1/source/REVISION.md\"}"},"time":{"start":1792433721309,"end":1792433721429}}}}
