{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792433732834,"sessionID":"ses_eaaa01f8affesgSTHulR12a46T","part":{"partID":"prt_155603cdb001K2Id05yq5ndPaZ","sessionID":"ses_eaaa01f8affesgSTHulR12a46T","messageID":"msg_1556030bb001vmcE6zV5ZwUeI0","type":"tool","id":"call_01_p3fsw2f21h0oda3mbyw5iyp8","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-4/blueprint-code-0-1/source/ACCEPTED_CASE_FACTS.json"},"output":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-4/blueprint-code-0-1/source/ACCEPTED_CASE_FACTS.json, lines 1-219\n1: {\n2:  \"accepted_evidence_ids\": [\n3:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_05babdea64ba9858\",\n4:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_06c81a165e03c96a\",\n5:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_1596da4a90687ca5\",\n6:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_3168bcd465b6a043\",\n7:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_35e41aab676021eb\",\n8:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_4c56ef30a1785be1\",\n9:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_6bbd7a588896fe31\",\n10:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_7150b0ac7a5678db\",\n11:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_7d47d725a2e9b759\",\n12:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_86ed2327f33a3ca8\",\n13:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_8e11efc61a4650ba\",\n14:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_922f1dbc84912d99\",\n15:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_93ef917a193a45ab\",\n16:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_93ff254508846f11\",\n17:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_9ab6b0e51811a16d\",\n18:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_b1ca64cf2ad02998\",\n19:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_c4ad7e52e5713628\",\n20:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_e62ae7e0a2c68ba1\",\n21:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_e7dd8d32c05c39f9\",\n22:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_ec303a2fd1afa287\"\n23:  ],\n24:  \"basis_digest\": \"a22ff1c065d27aecb0cee21dc6b597f5607375bc8ebc297a3451e708f4da5589\",\n25:  \"facts\": [\n26:   {\n27:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n28:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n29:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_05babdea64ba9858\",\n30:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n31:    \"statement\": \"New records are built with id `bm-${crypto.randomUUID()}`, hostname from getHostname(url), and defaults visitCount=0, visitedAt=null, isPinned=false, isArchived=false, createdAt=Date.now(); edits preserve the previous id, isPinned, isArchived, visitCount, createdAt, and visitedAt.\"\n32:   },\n33:   {\n34:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n35:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n36:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_06c81a165e03c96a\",\n37:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n38:    \"statement\": \"Pin/Unpin and Edit actions are rendered only when the item is not archived, and Edit loads the item's url/title/description/tags/favicon into the dialog.\"\n39:   },\n40:   {\n41:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n42:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n43:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_1596da4a90687ca5\",\n44:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n45:    \"statement\": \"The Valibot BookmarkFormSchema requires a non-empty URL matching /^https?:\\\\/\\\\/(?:[\\\\w-]+\\\\.)+[a-zA-Z]{2,}(?:\\\\/\\\\S*)?$/ and v.url, a non-empty title up to 100 chars, a non-empty description up to 280 chars, and 1-5 tags each up to 30 chars.\"\n46:   },\n47:   {\n48:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n49:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n50:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_3168bcd465b6a043\",\n51:    \"kind\": \"inference\",\n52:    \"statement\": \"The scenario's user-controlled 'category' (归类) is realized only as up to five free-text tags on each record; there are no creatable, renameable, or nestable collections, and no separate move operation beyond editing tags.\"\n53:   },\n54:   {\n55:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n56:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n57:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_35e41aab676021eb\",\n58:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n59:    \"statement\": \"saveBookmark sets the record in the in-memory map then awaits db.bookmarks.put(bm); deleteBookmark removes from the map then awaits db.bookmarks.delete(id).\"\n60:   },\n61:   {\n62:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n63:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n64:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_4c56ef30a1785be1\",\n65:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n66:    \"statement\": \"A Delete action is rendered only for archived items; it calls deleteBookmark and shows an error-type toast with an Undo action that calls saveBookmark(item) to restore the record.\"\n67:   },\n68:   {\n69:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n70:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n71:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_6bbd7a588896fe31\",\n72:    \"kind\": \"inference\",\n73:    \"statement\": \"The scenario step of letting unclassified links land in a default category is not supported, because the form schema rejects saves with zero tags.\"\n74:   },\n75:   {\n76:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n77:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n78:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_7150b0ac7a5678db\",\n79:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n80:    \"statement\": \"A Copy URL action writes item.url to the clipboard and shows a success toast.\"\n81:   },\n82:   {\n83:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n84:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n85:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_7d47d725a2e9b759\",\n86:    \"kind\": \"inference\",\n87:    \"statement\": \"Metadata and favicon enrichment is best-effort and dependent on third-party HTTP services; failures degrade silently to console errors while the bookmark still saves with whatever fields the user entered or omitted defaults for.\"\n88:   },\n89:   {\n90:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n91:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n92:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_86ed2327f33a3ca8\",\n93:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n94:    \"statement\": \"An effect on component creation calls db.bookmarks.toArray() and inserts each returned bookmark into an in-memory RippleMap keyed by bookmark id.\"\n95:   },\n96:   {\n97:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n98:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n99:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_8e11efc61a4650ba\",\n100:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n101:    \"statement\": \"On submit, if no favicon exists and a hostname is derivable, the code fetches a Google s2 favicon proxied through images.weserv.nl inside a try/catch that only logs failure.\"\n102:   },\n103:   {\n104:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n105:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n106:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_922f1dbc84912d99\",\n107:    \"kind\": \"inference\",\n108:    \"statement\": \"Persistence is local to one browser profile/device via IndexedDB with no sync layer, so the scenario's cross-session growth holds only on the same browser, and the leaf's multi-device context is unmet.\"\n109:   },\n110:   {\n111:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n112:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n113:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_93ef917a193a45ab\",\n114:    \"kind\": \"inference\",\n115:    \"statement\": \"Deletion is limited to archived records and recovery is only the transient Undo action on the toast; there is no trash view, and non-archived records cannot be deleted at all through the UI.\"\n116:   },\n117:   {\n118:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n119:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n120:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_93ff254508846f11\",\n121:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n122:    \"statement\": \"The Visit action builds an updated bookmark with visitedAt=Date.now() and visitCount+1, calls saveBookmark(updated), then opens the URL with window.open(item.url, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer').\"\n123:   },\n124:   {\n125:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n126:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n127:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_9ab6b0e51811a16d\",\n128:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n129:    \"statement\": \"The displayed list filters by isArchived matching the active tab, requires every selected tag to be present in bookmark.tags, matches search only against bookmark.title.toLowerCase(), and sorts pinned-first then by the chosen sort mode with createdAt descending as fallback.\"\n130:   },\n131:   {\n132:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n133:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n134:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_b1ca64cf2ad02998\",\n135:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n136:    \"statement\": \"The Archive/Unarchive action toggles isArchived and, when archiving, forces isPinned=false before saving.\"\n137:   },\n138:   {\n139:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n140:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n141:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_c4ad7e52e5713628\",\n142:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n143:    \"statement\": \"Tag counts are derived by iterating all in-memory bookmarks and counting each tag occurrence, then sorted alphabetically for the sidebar.\"\n144:   },\n145:   {\n146:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n147:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n148:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_e62ae7e0a2c68ba1\",\n149:    \"kind\": \"inference\",\n150:    \"statement\": \"Retrieval by keyword covers only bookmark titles, not URLs, descriptions, or tag names, so the scenario's 'find by a remembered word' workflow is partially supported.\"\n151:   },\n152:   {\n153:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n154:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n155:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_e7dd8d32c05c39f9\",\n156:    \"kind\": \"inference\",\n157:    \"statement\": \"The app supports the scenario's save-now/find-later loop: a deliberate add dialog writes a URL-anchored record into durable IndexedDB, and the record can later be browsed, tag-filtered, title-searched, and opened back to the live URL.\"\n158:   },\n159:   {\n160:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n161:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n162:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_ec303a2fd1afa287\",\n163:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n164:    \"statement\": \"fetchMeta calls https://api.microlink.io/?url=... and, on success with result.data, sets title/description and fetches the logo through https://images.weserv.nl/; errors are only console.error'd and the finally block resets loading.\"\n165:   }\n166:  ],\n167:  \"policy\": \"accepted-linked-observations-only-v1\",\n168:  \"schema\": \"atlas.accepted-case-facts.v1\",\n169:  \"source_research_digest\": \"9053da8cb157b5bec6ce698e163e208b5a500a3c121d12a6b1b8855aadba0238\",\n170:  \"status\": \"accepted\",\n171:  \"unknowns\": [\n172:   {\n173:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n174:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n175:    \"statement\": \"Behavior of Ripple TS reactivity primitives (track/effect/bindGroup/bindValue) at this pinned version was not validated.\"\n176:   },\n177:   {\n178:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n179:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n180:    \"statement\": \"Host excluded unsupported evidence inf-no-tests: Depends on a quarantined, unlocated observation\"\n181:   },\n182:   {\n183:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n184:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n185:    \"statement\": \"Host excluded unsupported evidence obs-no-test-files: observation cites an unknown source path: source/src\"\n186:   },\n187:   {\n188:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n189:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n190:    \"statement\": \"No automated tests exist in the manifest, so none of the described behaviors are test-confirmed.\"\n191:   },\n192:   {\n193:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n194:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n195:    \"statement\": \"Runtime behavior was not observed; all claims are static reading of source files.\"\n196:   },\n197:   {\n198:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n199:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n200:    \"statement\": \"The full commit tree was inferred from the supplied source_manifest and the on-disk source/ directory; files outside it were not inspected.\"\n201:   },\n202:   {\n203:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n204:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n205:    \"statement\": \"The paired Research Notes referenced by leaf.md were not supplied, so product-level evidence beyond the pinned repository is unavailable.\"\n206:   },\n207:   {\n208:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n209:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n210:    \"statement\": \"Whether Dexie/IndexedDB persistence behaves correctly in real browsers at this commit is unverified.\"\n211:   },\n212:   {\n213:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n214:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n215:    \"statement\": \"Whether the third-party metadata/favicon endpoints (api.microlink.io, images.weserv.nl, Google s2 favicons) are reachable, rate-limited, or CORS-permitted at runtime is unverified.\"\n216:   }\n217:  ],\n218:  \"view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\"\n219: }","title":"read","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-4/blueprint-code-0-1/source/ACCEPTED_CASE_FACTS.json, lines 1-219\n1: {\n2:  \"accepted_evidence_ids\": [\n3:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_05babdea64ba9858\",\n4:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_06c81a165e03c96a\",\n5:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_1596da4a90687ca5\",\n6:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_3168bcd465b6a043\",\n7:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_35e41aab676021eb\",\n8:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_4c56ef30a1785be1\",\n9:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_6bbd7a588896fe31\",\n10:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_7150b0ac7a5678db\",\n11:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_7d47d725a2e9b759\",\n12:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_86ed2327f33a3ca8\",\n13:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_8e11efc61a4650ba\",\n14:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_922f1dbc84912d99\",\n15:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_93ef917a193a45ab\",\n16:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_93ff254508846f11\",\n17:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_9ab6b0e51811a16d\",\n18:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_b1ca64cf2ad02998\",\n19:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_c4ad7e52e5713628\",\n20:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_e62ae7e0a2c68ba1\",\n21:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_e7dd8d32c05c39f9\",\n22:   \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_ec303a2fd1afa287\"\n23:  ],\n24:  \"basis_digest\": \"a22ff1c065d27aecb0cee21dc6b597f5607375bc8ebc297a3451e708f4da5589\",\n25:  \"facts\": [\n26:   {\n27:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n28:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n29:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_05babdea64ba9858\",\n30:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n31:    \"statement\": \"New records are built with id `bm-${crypto.randomUUID()}`, hostname from getHostname(url), and defaults visitCount=0, visitedAt=null, isPinned=false, isArchived=false, createdAt=Date.now(); edits preserve the previous id, isPinned, isArchived, visitCount, createdAt, and visitedAt.\"\n32:   },\n33:   {\n34:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n35:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n36:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_06c81a165e03c96a\",\n37:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n38:    \"statement\": \"Pin/Unpin and Edit actions are rendered only when the item is not archived, and Edit loads the item's url/title/description/tags/favicon into the dialog.\"\n39:   },\n40:   {\n41:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n42:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n43:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_1596da4a90687ca5\",\n44:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n45:    \"statement\": \"The Valibot BookmarkFormSchema requires a non-empty URL matching /^https?:\\\\/\\\\/(?:[\\\\w-]+\\\\.)+[a-zA-Z]{2,}(?:\\\\/\\\\S*)?$/ and v.url, a non-empty title up to 100 chars, a non-empty description up to 280 chars, and 1-5 tags each up to 30 chars.\"\n46:   },\n47:   {\n48:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n49:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n50:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_3168bcd465b6a043\",\n51:    \"kind\": \"inference\",\n52:    \"statement\": \"The scenario's user-controlled 'category' (归类) is realized only as up to five free-text tags on each record; there are no creatable, renameable, or nestable collections, and no separate move operation beyond editing tags.\"\n53:   },\n54:   {\n55:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n56:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n57:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_35e41aab676021eb\",\n58:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n59:    \"statement\": \"saveBookmark sets the record in the in-memory map then awaits db.bookmarks.put(bm); deleteBookmark removes from the map then awaits db.bookmarks.delete(id).\"\n60:   },\n61:   {\n62:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n63:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n64:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_4c56ef30a1785be1\",\n65:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n66:    \"statement\": \"A Delete action is rendered only for archived items; it calls deleteBookmark and shows an error-type toast with an Undo action that calls saveBookmark(item) to restore the record.\"\n67:   },\n68:   {\n69:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n70:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n71:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_6bbd7a588896fe31\",\n72:    \"kind\": \"inference\",\n73:    \"statement\": \"The scenario step of letting unclassified links land in a default category is not supported, because the form schema rejects saves with zero tags.\"\n74:   },\n75:   {\n76:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n77:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n78:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_7150b0ac7a5678db\",\n79:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n80:    \"statement\": \"A Copy URL action writes item.url to the clipboard and shows a success toast.\"\n81:   },\n82:   {\n83:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n84:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n85:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_7d47d725a2e9b759\",\n86:    \"kind\": \"inference\",\n87:    \"statement\": \"Metadata and favicon enrichment is best-effort and dependent on third-party HTTP services; failures degrade silently to console errors while the bookmark still saves with whatever fields the user entered or omitted defaults for.\"\n88:   },\n89:   {\n90:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n91:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n92:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_86ed2327f33a3ca8\",\n93:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n94:    \"statement\": \"An effect on component creation calls db.bookmarks.toArray() and inserts each returned bookmark into an in-memory RippleMap keyed by bookmark id.\"\n95:   },\n96:   {\n97:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n98:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n99:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_8e11efc61a4650ba\",\n100:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n101:    \"statement\": \"On submit, if no favicon exists and a hostname is derivable, the code fetches a Google s2 favicon proxied through images.weserv.nl inside a try/catch that only logs failure.\"\n102:   },\n103:   {\n104:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n105:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n106:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_922f1dbc84912d99\",\n107:    \"kind\": \"inference\",\n108:    \"statement\": \"Persistence is local to one browser profile/device via IndexedDB with no sync layer, so the scenario's cross-session growth holds only on the same browser, and the leaf's multi-device context is unmet.\"\n109:   },\n110:   {\n111:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n112:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n113:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_93ef917a193a45ab\",\n114:    \"kind\": \"inference\",\n115:    \"statement\": \"Deletion is limited to archived records and recovery is only the transient Undo action on the toast; there is no trash view, and non-archived records cannot be deleted at all through the UI.\"\n116:   },\n117:   {\n118:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n119:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n120:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_93ff254508846f11\",\n121:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n122:    \"statement\": \"The Visit action builds an updated bookmark with visitedAt=Date.now() and visitCount+1, calls saveBookmark(updated), then opens the URL with window.open(item.url, '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer').\"\n123:   },\n124:   {\n125:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n126:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n127:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_9ab6b0e51811a16d\",\n128:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n129:    \"statement\": \"The displayed list filters by isArchived matching the active tab, requires every selected tag to be present in bookmark.tags, matches search only against bookmark.title.toLowerCase(), and sorts pinned-first then by the chosen sort mode with createdAt descending as fallback.\"\n130:   },\n131:   {\n132:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n133:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n134:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_b1ca64cf2ad02998\",\n135:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n136:    \"statement\": \"The Archive/Unarchive action toggles isArchived and, when archiving, forces isPinned=false before saving.\"\n137:   },\n138:   {\n139:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n140:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n141:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_c4ad7e52e5713628\",\n142:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n143:    \"statement\": \"Tag counts are derived by iterating all in-memory bookmarks and counting each tag occurrence, then sorted alphabetically for the sidebar.\"\n144:   },\n145:   {\n146:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n147:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n148:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_e62ae7e0a2c68ba1\",\n149:    \"kind\": \"inference\",\n150:    \"statement\": \"Retrieval by keyword covers only bookmark titles, not URLs, descriptions, or tag names, so the scenario's 'find by a remembered word' workflow is partially supported.\"\n151:   },\n152:   {\n153:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n154:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n155:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_e7dd8d32c05c39f9\",\n156:    \"kind\": \"inference\",\n157:    \"statement\": \"The app supports the scenario's save-now/find-later loop: a deliberate add dialog writes a URL-anchored record into durable IndexedDB, and the record can later be browsed, tag-filtered, title-searched, and opened back to the live URL.\"\n158:   },\n159:   {\n160:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n161:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n162:    \"evidence_id\": \"ev_ba200adf6e2c_ec303a2fd1afa287\",\n163:    \"kind\": \"code_observation\",\n164:    \"statement\": \"fetchMeta calls https://api.microlink.io/?url=... and, on success with result.data, sets title/description and fetches the logo through https://images.weserv.nl/; errors are only console.error'd and the finally block resets loading.\"\n165:   }\n166:  ],\n167:  \"policy\": \"accepted-linked-observations-only-v1\",\n168:  \"schema\": \"atlas.accepted-case-facts.v1\",\n169:  \"source_research_digest\": \"9053da8cb157b5bec6ce698e163e208b5a500a3c121d12a6b1b8855aadba0238\",\n170:  \"status\": \"accepted\",\n171:  \"unknowns\": [\n172:   {\n173:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n174:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n175:    \"statement\": \"Behavior of Ripple TS reactivity primitives (track/effect/bindGroup/bindValue) at this pinned version was not validated.\"\n176:   },\n177:   {\n178:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n179:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n180:    \"statement\": \"Host excluded unsupported evidence inf-no-tests: Depends on a quarantined, unlocated observation\"\n181:   },\n182:   {\n183:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n184:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n185:    \"statement\": \"Host excluded unsupported evidence obs-no-test-files: observation cites an unknown source path: source/src\"\n186:   },\n187:   {\n188:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n189:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n190:    \"statement\": \"No automated tests exist in the manifest, so none of the described behaviors are test-confirmed.\"\n191:   },\n192:   {\n193:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n194:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n195:    \"statement\": \"Runtime behavior was not observed; all claims are static reading of source files.\"\n196:   },\n197:   {\n198:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n199:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n200:    \"statement\": \"The full commit tree was inferred from the supplied source_manifest and the on-disk source/ directory; files outside it were not inspected.\"\n201:   },\n202:   {\n203:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n204:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n205:    \"statement\": \"The paired Research Notes referenced by leaf.md were not supplied, so product-level evidence beyond the pinned repository is unavailable.\"\n206:   },\n207:   {\n208:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n209:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n210:    \"statement\": \"Whether Dexie/IndexedDB persistence behaves correctly in real browsers at this commit is unverified.\"\n211:   },\n212:   {\n213:    \"case_id\": \"case:product-c42848f63251507bd9d911a5:faa52e6b1414\",\n214:    \"case_revision\": 1,\n215:    \"statement\": \"Whether the third-party metadata/favicon endpoints (api.microlink.io, images.weserv.nl, Google s2 favicons) are reachable, rate-limited, or CORS-permitted at runtime is unverified.\"\n216:   }\n217:  ],\n218:  \"view_digest\": \"241bf3d99ff497c30be8349cbc70529e08df6146736cb749b55268271889aa4b\"\n219: }"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\": \"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-4/blueprint-code-0-1/source/ACCEPTED_CASE_FACTS.json\"}"},"time":{"start":1792433732827,"end":1792433732834}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792433732835,"sessionID":"ses_eaaa01f8affesgSTHulR12a46T","part":{"partID":"prt_155603cd8001MZVS5Vcgs5BYIL","sessionID":"ses_eaaa01f8affesgSTHulR12a46T","messageID":"msg_1556030bb001vmcE6zV5ZwUeI0","type":"tool","id":"call_00_wyhhzw0lk858f0p8ymoflpk7","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-4/blueprint-code-0-1/source/RESEARCH.md"},"output":"Read file /Users/milin/2026/软件开发/application-atlas/application-atlas-production-pack/atlas/template-factory/jobs/job_7742b1c124be4c9ab3a0096da5cdd772/attempt-4/blueprint-code-0-1/source/RESEARCH.md, lines 1-210\n1: ev_ba200adf6e2c_05babdea64ba9858 [code_observation]: New records are built with id `bm-${crypto.randomUUID()}`, hostname\n2: from getHostname(url), and defaults visitCount=0, visitedAt=null, isPinned=false, isArchived=false,\n3: createdAt=Date.now(); edits preserve the previous id, isPinned, isArchived, visitCount, createdAt, and visitedAt.\n4: \n5: ev_ba200adf6e2c_06c81a165e03c96a [code_observation]: Pin/Unpin and Edit actions are rendered only when the item is not\n6: archived, and Edit loads the item's url/title/description/tags/favicon into the dialog.\n7: \n8: ev_ba200adf6e2c_1596da4a90687ca5 [code_observation]: The Valibot BookmarkFormSchema requires a non-empty URL matching\n9: /^https?:\\/\\/(?:[\\w-]+\\.)+[a-zA-Z]{2,}(?:\\/\\S*)?$/ and v.url, a non-empty title up to 100 chars, a non-empty description\n10: up to 280 chars, and 1-5 tags each up to 30 chars.\n11: \n12: ev_ba200adf6e2c_3168bcd465b6a043 [inference]: The scenario's user-controlled 'category' (归类) is realized only as up to\n13: five free-text tags on each record; there are no creatable, renameable, or nestable collections, and no separate move\n14: operation beyond editing tags.\n15: \n16: ev_ba200adf6e2c_35e41aab676021eb [code_observation]: saveBookmark sets the record in the in-memory map then awaits\n17: db.bookmarks.put(bm); deleteBookmark removes from the map then awaits db.bookmarks.delete(id).\n18: \n19: ev_ba200adf6e2c_4c56ef30a1785be1 [code_observation]: A Delete action is rendered only for archived items; it calls\n20: deleteBookmark and shows an error-type toast with an Undo action that calls saveBookmark(item) to restore the record.\n21: \n22: ev_ba200adf6e2c_6bbd7a588896fe31 [inference]: The scenario step of letting unclassified links land in a default category\n23: is not supported, because the form schema rejects saves with zero tags.\n24: \n25: ev_ba200adf6e2c_7150b0ac7a5678db [code_observation]: A Copy URL action writes item.url to the clipboard and shows a\n26: success toast.\n27: \n28: ev_ba200adf6e2c_7d47d725a2e9b759 [inference]: Metadata and favicon enrichment is best-effort and dependent on\n29: third-party HTTP services; failures degrade silently to console errors while the bookmark still saves with whatever\n30: fields the user entered or omitted defaults for.\n31: \n32: ev_ba200adf6e2c_86ed2327f33a3ca8 [code_observation]: An effect on component creation calls db.bookmarks.toArray() and\n33: inserts each returned bookmark into an in-memory RippleMap keyed by bookmark id.\n34: \n35: ev_ba200adf6e2c_8e11efc61a4650ba [code_observation]: On submit, if no favicon exists and a hostname is derivable, the\n36: code fetches a Google s2 favicon proxied through images.weserv.nl inside a try/catch that only logs failure.\n37: \n38: ev_ba200adf6e2c_922f1dbc84912d99 [inference]: Persistence is local to one browser profile/device via IndexedDB with no\n39: sync layer, so the scenario's cross-session growth holds only on the same browser, and the leaf's multi-device context\n40: is unmet.\n41: \n42: ev_ba200adf6e2c_93ef917a193a45ab [inference]: Deletion is limited to archived records and recovery is only the transient\n43: Undo action on the toast; there is no trash view, and non-archived records cannot be deleted at all through the UI.\n44: \n45: ev_ba200adf6e2c_93ff254508846f11 [code_observation]: The Visit action builds an updated bookmark with\n46: visitedAt=Date.now() and visitCount+1, calls saveBookmark(updated), then opens the URL with window.open(item.url,\n47: '_blank', 'noopener,noreferrer').\n48: \n49: ev_ba200adf6e2c_9ab6b0e51811a16d [code_observation]: The displayed list filters by isArchived matching the active tab,\n50: requires every selected tag to be present in bookmark.tags, matches search only against bookmark.title.toLowerCase(),\n51: and sorts pinned-first then by the chosen sort mode with createdAt descending as fallback.\n52: \n53: ev_ba200adf6e2c_b1ca64cf2ad02998 [code_observation]: The Archive/Unarchive action toggles isArchived and, when\n54: archiving, forces isPinned=false before saving.\n55: \n56: ev_ba200adf6e2c_c4ad7e52e5713628 [code_observation]: Tag counts are derived by iterating all in-memory bookmarks and\n57: counting each tag occurrence, then sorted alphabetically for the sidebar.\n58: \n59: ev_ba200adf6e2c_e62ae7e0a2c68ba1 [inference]: Retrieval by keyword covers only bookmark titles, not URLs, descriptions,\n60: or tag names, so the scenario's 'find by a remembered word' workflow is partially supported.\n61: \n62: ev_ba200adf6e2c_e7dd8d32c05c39f9 [inference]: The app supports the scenario's save-now/find-later loop: a deliberate add\n63: dialog writes a URL-anchored record into durable IndexedDB, and the record can later be browsed, tag-filtered,\n64: title-searched, and opened back to the live URL.\n65: \n66: ev_ba200adf6e2c_ec303a2fd1afa287 [code_observation]: fetchMeta calls https://api.microlink.io/?url=... and, on success\n67: with result.data, sets title/description and fetches the logo through https://images.weserv.nl/; errors are only\n68: console.error'd and the finally block resets loading.\n69: \n70: id: S02\n71: name: ev_ba200adf6e2c_05babdea64ba9858\n72: url: https://github.com/lakhindarpal/bookmark-manager/blob/539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623/src/App.tsrx\n73: version: 539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623\n74: facts: New records are built with id `bm-${crypto.randomUUID()}`, hostname from getHostname(url), and defaults\n75: visitCount=0, visitedAt=null, isPinned=false, isArchived=false, createdAt=Date.now(); edits preserve the previous id,\n76: isPinned, isArchived, visitCount, createdAt, and visitedAt.\n77: license: Fixed source license/NOTICE hashes in inputs/case-basis.json; legal reuse review not performed.\n78: reuse: Independently accepted code_observation; design adaptation is recorded separately; upstream not run.\n79: \n80: id: S03\n81: name: ev_ba200adf6e2c_06c81a165e03c96a\n82: url: https://github.com/lakhindarpal/bookmark-manager/blob/539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623/src/App.tsrx\n83: version: 539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623\n84: facts: Pin/Unpin and Edit actions are rendered only when the item is not archived, and Edit loads the item's\n85: url/title/description/tags/favicon into the dialog.\n86: license: Fixed source license/NOTICE hashes in inputs/case-basis.json; legal reuse review not performed.\n87: reuse: Independently accepted code_observation; design adaptation is recorded separately; upstream not run.\n88: \n89: id: S04\n90: name: ev_ba200adf6e2c_1596da4a90687ca5\n91: url: https://github.com/lakhindarpal/bookmark-manager/blob/539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623/src/App.tsrx\n92: version: 539881bc67099d491e8ab6f85de0f443fa7de623\n93: facts: The Valibot BookmarkFormSchema requires a non-empty URL matching\n94: /^https?:\\/\\/(?:[\\w-]+\\.)+[a-zA-Z]{2,}(?:\\/\\S*)?$/ and v.url, a non-empty title up to 100 chars, a non-empty description\n95: up to 280 chars, and 1-5 tags each up to 30 chars.\n96: license: Fixed source license/NOTICE hashes in inputs/case-basis.json; legal reuse review not performed.\n97: reuse: Independently accepted code_observation; design adaptation is recorded separately; upstream not run.\n98: \n99: